{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/3b97b370b262eea757af007f92bbbb8e.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/3b97b370b262eea757af007f92bbbb8e.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/3b97b370b262eea757af007f92bbbb8e.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through absurd layers of history as a rat-dog-witch trying to escape employment and transcend reality. Explore weird museums, cosmic hallways, and your own bad dreams in a chaotic mash-up of art, humor, and a playable existential crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/7780ea109641f04470e609778f6be442.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/7780ea109641f04470e609778f6be442.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/7780ea109641f04470e609778f6be442.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuzz Dungeon invites players into an evolving funhouse of human absurdity. Enter into a playable collage of forgotten centuries, workplace dread, and divine nonsense. Each floor feels like a fever dream of culture itself, only it's been put through a broken xerox machine and dunked in a concoction of strange chemicals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/0927ab0c9654732641862f45b5aaf20d.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/0927ab0c9654732641862f45b5aaf20d.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/0927ab0c9654732641862f45b5aaf20d.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the systems collapse-- time becomes malleable, enemies become jokes, and your inventory fills with objects that shouldn\u2019t exist. But you're not just exploring the dungeon; you're travelling through an absurdist version of human history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/8cae77a901b239317ffb87c05d6bfc8d.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/8cae77a901b239317ffb87c05d6bfc8d.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/8cae77a901b239317ffb87c05d6bfc8d.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny, sad, and endlessly strange, Fuzz Dungeon is a pilgrimage through the chaos of creation. A game about getting lost, laughing about it, and realizing the exit might just be the punchline.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Well destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/6c4e8ed2127ed1f93a210ffc2b42f7e98e305752.jpg"},{"name":"Mushrooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/542b43482660b35e821450c9586bd1100cbc25c3.jpg"},{"name":"Dungeon Head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/a864fd37cd5a1da1d27dd480265d70f290fab15e.jpg"},{"name":"Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/e42fe47cc221ee64ca7df85c49d324fa1e067868.jpg"},{"name":"Sports","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/d4329443636bef8541b747dadf234116e026177e.jpg"},{"name":"Puke Passages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/238bee287154fdef6f8bc3702a16cced67e74143.jpg"},{"name":"Big Heads","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/39a59cccb5382118189ac403d214c9b864ad160e.jpg"},{"name":"Image Marketplace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/dedf7eeea9b1de3c042fcf08df483c9e9990e446.jpg"},{"name":"Conversationalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/708d4ff9205b3c0c70552268526765f56c1078d2.jpg"},{"name":"Assembly Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1506080/bb1988420c8fb49c1d313f64f2778b38f3528b38.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1506080?t=1765472936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/6d3f92522b25f1065473cb23a6b7167b64766d5f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765472936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/752abcc1c1ee3811ec3e17a859f38d3e938ba50a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765472936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/752abcc1c1ee3811ec3e17a859f38d3e938ba50a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765472936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rat Dog Reality:</strong> A very focused rat dog just trying to break into higher planes of existence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Levels:</strong> Explore 15 bizarre stages, each built around a completely different gameplay style, mood, and ruleset.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Soundscapes:</strong> Chris Parrello and Lobby Hotel deliver an eclectic, reality-bending soundtrack that mutates with every floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Ridiculousness:</strong> Everything inside is high-scorable. Please speedrun this game. I'm begging.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/3b97b370b262eea757af007f92bbbb8e.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/3b97b370b262eea757af007f92bbbb8e.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/3b97b370b262eea757af007f92bbbb8e.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through absurd layers of history as a rat-dog-witch trying to escape employment and transcend reality. Explore weird museums, cosmic hallways, and your own bad dreams in a chaotic mash-up of art, humor, and a playable existential crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/7780ea109641f04470e609778f6be442.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/7780ea109641f04470e609778f6be442.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/7780ea109641f04470e609778f6be442.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuzz Dungeon invites players into an evolving funhouse of human absurdity. Enter into a playable collage of forgotten centuries, workplace dread, and divine nonsense. Each floor feels like a fever dream of culture itself, only it's been put through a broken xerox machine and dunked in a concoction of strange chemicals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/0927ab0c9654732641862f45b5aaf20d.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/0927ab0c9654732641862f45b5aaf20d.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/0927ab0c9654732641862f45b5aaf20d.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the systems collapse-- time becomes malleable, enemies become jokes, and your inventory fills with objects that shouldn\u2019t exist. But you're not just exploring the dungeon; you're travelling through an absurdist version of human history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/8cae77a901b239317ffb87c05d6bfc8d.poster.avif?t=1765472936\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/8cae77a901b239317ffb87c05d6bfc8d.webm?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/extras/8cae77a901b239317ffb87c05d6bfc8d.mp4?t=1765472936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny, sad, and endlessly strange, Fuzz Dungeon is a pilgrimage through the chaos of creation. A game about getting lost, laughing about it, and realizing the exit might just be the punchline.</p>","developers":["Jeremy Couillard"],"dlc":[1675120],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1506080/6fbcb0d83a4098c3ac23c8714e0c73147144b721/header.jpg?t=1765472936","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1506080/1875102324/d3399b6902ca4013dca786904a7b366b089440df/1764730897/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765472933","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1506080/1875102324/d3399b6902ca4013dca786904a7b366b089440df/1764730897/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765472933","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1506080/1875102324/d3399b6902ca4013dca786904a7b366b089440df/1764730897/hls_264_mast